@startuml context
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white

actor "Customer" as customer
actor "Admin" as admin
rectangle "CarRentalVSB\n(reservation system)" as app
rectangle "Notification Service\n(external boundary)" as notif

customer --> app : browses cars, creates/\nconfirms/cancels reservations (HTTPS)
admin --> app : manages fleet\nand reservations (HTTPS)
app --> notif : send_confirmation(reservation, user)
@enduml
